            "taskDemandEn": "Compare supplied reactions of ethane with Cl2 under UV and ethene with Br2 under suitable conditions. Mark what was replaced versus added in each product.",
            "expectedPerformanceDe": "Die lernende Person beschreibt radikalische H-Substitution beim Alkan und Addition beider Br-Atome an die C=C-Bindung des Alkens.",
            "expectedPerformanceEn": "The learner describes radical H substitution in the alkane and addition of both Br atoms across the alkene C=C bond.",
