            "taskDemandEn": "Fresh fictional salt model S with monovalent cations/anions:separation+700, hydration−740kJ/mol;0.05mol. A text claims “dissolution costs energy, so every salt solution cools”. Refute the claim using the balance and a correct particle model. State a limit on conclusions about actual solubility.",
