            "observablePerformanceEn": "Slope.8L/g; diluted.30g/L, original6g/L, 1.5g in250mL. Check blank/standard, dilution, interferences/linearity. GOD/POD is glucose-specific, not all sugars; g/L is mass not amount concentration."
