            "taskDemandEn": "Choose provided GOD/POD colour test for glucose in model juice rather than nonspecific total sugars. Synthetic505nm/1cm data: standards0, .10, .20, .40g/L absorbance0, .08, .16, .32; 20fold diluted sample.24. Calibrate, calculate original mass concentration/mass in250mL and justify method/controls.",
